                <pb facs="0739" n="677" sameAs="frus:frus1878/pg677"/>

                <p rendition="#center">(Sent from Camargo April 27, 1878. Received at the city of
                    Mexico at 8.10 p.m.)</p>
                <p rendition="#flush">Citizen Minister of War:</p>
                <p>Invading force from Texas crossed river last night opposite Reynosa.</p>
                <closer><signed>M. SEVILLA.</signed></closer>
            </div>
